uparams=e,og,oi,mid,deadline,uipk,gen,platform,trid,nbs,os&bvc=vod&nettype=0&bw=403552&lrs=-1&f=u_0_0&qn_dyeid=a6c63cb9a3ee16ca00abafb36ab0ee78&agrr=1&buvid=E8010D3A-ED79-58C9-1608-9BD0630C03B175654infoc&build=0&dl=0&orderid=0,3", "ext": "mp4", "fps": 27.5, "width": 1280, "height": 720, "vcodec": "avc1.640033", "acodec": "none", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "tbr": 402.916, "quality": 64, "format_id": "30064", "format": "720P 准高清", "protocol": "https", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "abr": 0, "vbr": 402.916, "resolution": "1280x720", "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "filesize_approx": 6001635, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bUnKziED2/"}}], "duration": 119.164, "subtitles": {"danmaku": [{"ext": "xml", "url": "https://comment.bilibili.com/32566478438.xml"}], "ai-zh": [{"ext": "srt", "data": "1\n00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880\n主播跟着江西科技入坑\n\n2\n00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:04,200\nSM32做了个小项目\n\n3\n00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,320\n检验下成果\n\n4\n00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,860\n用到了这些外线模块\n\n5\n00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,900\n基础功能如图所示\n\n6\n00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,380\n爱组合功能\n\n7\n00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,640\n这个是原理图\n\n8\n00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,600\n后面开始实操一温控功能\n\n9\n00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:23,430\n这里用EC1E旋钮编码器控制温度\n\n10\n00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:25,790\n当预设温度低于环境温度时\n\n11\n00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:28,710\n电机模拟压缩机启动运行\n\n12\n00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,490\n调高一些温度\n\n13\n00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,710\n压缩机停止运行\n\n14\n00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,880\n二开门亮灯功能\n\n15\n00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,880\n这里用跳线模拟开关冰箱门\n\n16\n00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:42,820\n冰箱门开启\n\n17\n00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:43,940\nled灯亮\n\n18\n00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,700\n三记录开关门\n\n19\n00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:49,460\n刺绣欧land向学习开门刺绣\n\n20\n00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,800\n四忘关门报警\n\n21\n00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:55,670\n长时间不关门\n\n22\n00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:57,130\n蜂鸣器间歇响起\n\n23\n00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,010\n关门后得停止报警\n\n24\n00:01:04,379 --> 00:01:06,580\n无网络时间戳\n\n25\n00:01:07,590 --> 00:01:09,970\n题目上第二行显示的时间戳\n\n26\n00:01:09,970 --> 00:01:13,950\n是用esp8266模块获取的网络时间\n\n27\n00:01:14,910 --> 00:01:18,750\n每一次开门还会将当前时间戳记录在e app里面\n\n28\n00:01:19,830 --> 00:01:22,320\nESE8266在这里\n\n29\n00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:25,650\n第一行是环境温度和设定温度\n\n30\n00:01:25,970 --> 00:01:29,790\n第三行是开门状态和检验是否阻塞的技术节\n\n31\n00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:32,370\n第四行是开门刺绣\n\n32\n00:01:33,970 --> 00:01:37,450\n接下来就是项目在GITHUB上面的详细介绍了\n\n33\n00:01:37,450 --> 00:01:39,810\n链接放在简介里面\n\n34\n00:01:41,070 --> 00:01:42,090\n不得不说\n\n35\n00:01:42,090 --> 00:01:46,230\n现在有了大模型学习代码排版真是太方便了\n\n36\n00:01:46,230 --> 00:01:49,050\n这也是属于我们的时代红利吧\n\n37\n00:01:49,050 --> 00:01:51,890\n最后欢迎各位大佬批评指正\n\n38\n00:01:51,890 --> 00:01:54,680\n特别感谢江西科技带我入坑\n\n"}]}, "webpage_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bUnKziED2/", "webpage_url_basename": "BV1bUnKziED2", "webpage_url_domain": "bilibili.com", "extractor": "BiliBili", "extractor_key": "BiliBili", "thumbnails": [{"url": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3cc306b73f4323cb7b5f76748d5afe7a0fe8d863.jpg", "id": "0"}], "display_id": "BV1bUnKziED2", "fulltitle": "学完江协科技STM32课程的第一个项目实战——冰箱功能模拟", "duration_string": "1:59", "upload_date": "20250923", "epoch": 1789980285, "format": "720P 准高清+30280 - audio only", "format_id": "30064+30280", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "filesize_approx": 8460360, "tbr": 567.981, "width": 1280, "height": 720, "resolution": "1280x720", "fps": 27.5, "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "avc1.640033", "vbr": 402.916, "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "acodec": "mp4a.40.2", "abr": 165.065, "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.08.30.232658", "release_git_head": "bbc809a1161d3bfca51fa36f59dda35556ee85a0", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp-nightly-builds"}}